{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_029_dinov2-title\">DINOv2</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 LVD-142M 数据策展配合 DINO+iBOT+KoLeo 复合自监督，并通过跨尺寸蒸馏形成模型家族。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Combines automated deduplication/retrieval curation (LVD-142M) with a composite DINO + iBOT + KoLeo objective and multi-resolution distillation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">经自动去重、检索与平衡构建的大规模无标签图像池</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Large-scale deduplicated and rebalanced unlabeled image corpus</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">跨域可迁移的全局与 patch 视觉特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Out-of-the-box transferable frozen global and dense patch embeddings across model scales</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=a68SUt6zFt\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_029_dinov2')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_029_dinov2')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DINOv2 original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/b6d4c62f5cfada1b9cf7.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_029_dinov2\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_029_dinov2')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_029_dinov2\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">原始图像池</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">从超大规模未整理网络图像出发。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests large-scale deduplicated and rebalanced unlabeled image corpus and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"从超大规模未整理网络图像出发。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests large-scale deduplicated and rebalanced unlabeled image corpus and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"原始图像池\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原始图像池</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从超大规模未整理网络图像出发。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests large-scale deduplicated and rebalanced unlabeled image corpus and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用种子数据、相似检索、去重与重平衡构造 1.42 亿图像训练集。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes LVD-142M to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"LVD-142M 策展\" data-node-name-en=\"LVD-142M\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">LVD-142M 策展</span><span class=\"lang-en\">LVD-142M</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用种子数据、相似检索、去重与重平衡构造 1.42 亿图像训练集。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes LVD-142M to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局/局部 crops 与 patch masking 同时生成训练视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Multi-Crop + Mask within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Multi-Crop + Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-Crop + Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Multi-Crop + Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局/局部 crops 与 patch masking 同时生成训练视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Multi-Crop + Mask within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ViT-g/14 等 student 输出 CLS 与 patch tokens，并接收梯度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Student ViT within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Student ViT\" data-node-name-en=\"Student ViT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Student ViT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ViT-g/14 等 student 输出 CLS 与 patch tokens，并接收梯度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Student ViT within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"teacher 产生平滑的图像级和 patch 级目标。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EMA Teacher within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"EMA Teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA Teacher\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EMA Teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">teacher 产生平滑的图像级和 patch 级目标。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EMA Teacher within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨视图 CLS 自蒸馏学习图像级语义不变性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DINO Loss within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"DINO Loss\" data-node-name-en=\"DINO Loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>DINO Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨视图 CLS 自蒸馏学习图像级语义不变性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DINO Loss within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"student 在被遮位置预测 teacher patch 分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs iBOT Loss within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"iBOT Loss\" data-node-name-en=\"iBOT Loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>iBOT Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">student 在被遮位置预测 teacher patch 分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs iBOT Loss within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"鼓励 batch 内特征在单位超球面更均匀分散，提升多样性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs KoLeo regularization within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"KoLeo 正则\" data-node-name-en=\"KoLeo regularization\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">KoLeo 正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">KoLeo regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">鼓励 batch 内特征在单位超球面更均匀分散，提升多样性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs KoLeo regularization within the core curated data composite self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用大 teacher 训练更小 ViT，保留高质量表征并降低部署成本。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies distillation to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"跨尺寸蒸馏\" data-node-name-en=\"distillation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">跨尺寸蒸馏</span><span class=\"lang-en\">distillation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用大 teacher 训练更小 ViT，保留高质量表征并降低部署成本。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies distillation to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"冻结 backbone 即可支持分类、检索、深度与密集预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces out-of-the-box transferable frozen global and dense patch embeddings across model scales via feature.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"通用视觉特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_029_dinov2', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通用视觉特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">冻结 backbone 即可支持分类、检索、深度与密集预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces out-of-the-box transferable frozen global and dense patch embeddings across model scales via feature.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DINOv2 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · DINO、iBOT 与 KoLeo 的复合目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Composite DINO Image Loss + iBOT Patch MIM Loss + KoLeo Uniformity Regularizer</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DINOv2：核心公式 · DINO、iBOT 与 KoLeo 的复合目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"29\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"29.776259pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.00913 242.536775 29.776259\" width=\"242.536775pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m029_g10-0\"></path><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511075C6.114059-6.511075 6.491225-6.352269 6.491225-5.855998C6.491225-5.657489 6.39197-5.468906 6.253014-5.32995V-5.220771C6.491225-5.300174 7.265407-5.657489 7.265407-5.945326C7.265407-6.580553 6.441597-6.838614 5.925476-6.838614C3.215836-6.838614 3.384568-4.02972 2.858521-2.133965C2.769192-1.796501 2.302697-.744406 1.895755-.744406C1.617843-.744406 1.349857-.853586 1.071945-.853586C.704705-.853586 .208434-.12903 .069478 .168732L.119105 .23821C.287837 .099254 .535973-.059553 .764257-.059553C2.441653-.059553 3.980093 .853586 5.657489 .853586C6.669882 .853586 7.066899 .198508 7.364661-.665003Z\" id=\"m029_g10-76\"></path><path d=\"M3.255538 1.9156