use><use x=\"-32.583443\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g4-61\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"-23.280618\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-76\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"-15.619356\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-68\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"-10.368444\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-73\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"-7.946624\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-78\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"-2.841177\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-79\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"5.121712\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-184\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"13.871072\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-76\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"21.532333\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-105\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"23.554151\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-66\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"28.223232\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-79\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"33.474144\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-84\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"40.629754\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-184\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"49.050347\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g16-95\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"54.62942\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-75\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"61.282366\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g7-34\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"65.098051\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-0\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"74.054451\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-49\" y=\"-58.211714\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"7.830621\" x=\"72.629801\" y=\"-54.306361\"></rect><use x=\"73.008382\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g16-35\" y=\"-44.632661\"></use><use x=\"83.316335\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g7-213\" y=\"-61.661272\"></use><use x=\"88.595716\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g13-56\" y=\"-40.12252\"></use><use x=\"98.157303\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-108\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"100.926915\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-111\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"105.908235\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-103\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"112.549955\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-109\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"120.300888\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-105\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"123.0705\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g23-110\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"115.844543\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g13-57\" y=\"-45.195994\"></use><use x=\"118.600903\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g1-60\" y=\"-45.195994\"></use><use x=\"123.226357\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g13-56\" y=\"-45.195994\"></use><use x=\"130.210354\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-107\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"134.932645\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g16-73\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"139.106988\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g13-56\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"144.440792\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-0\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"153.229999\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g16-73\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"158.495248\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g13-57\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"162.247875\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g10-107\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"166.731061\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g20-50\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"171.064808\" xlink:href=\"#m029_g7-35\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">早期 SSL 的数据治理与大规模训练配方难扩展、难复现</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Prior self-supervised models degraded on uncurated web noise and often required full end-to-end fine-tuning for dense tasks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在清洗的 LVD-142M 上结合 DINO、iBOT 与 KoLeo 训练可复用视觉特征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Curate a balanced, deduplicated pretraining corpus via embedding retrieval and train a scalable ViT family with composite self-distillation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">自动数据筛选、复合自蒸馏目标和多尺寸蒸馏</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Automated data curation pipeline + DINO + untied-head iBOT + KoLeo sphere uniformity regularizer + high-resolution short adaptation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">直接支撑 UNI、Virchow 等病理 foundation encoder</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Forms the direct algorithmic backbone of modern pathology foundation encoders (UNI, Virchow, Prov-GigaPath) and RAD-DINO.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">强通用特征底座；自然图像域不能自动覆盖灰阶、3D 和微小病灶</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Gold-standard frozen visual feature extractor; natural-image weights still benefit from in-domain medical adaptation for 3D/grayscale.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">数据策展是结构的一部分：去重和与目标域相似的重平衡直接决定基础表征覆盖面。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">DINO 图像目标、iBOT patch 目标和 KoLeo 分散正则共同约束语义、稠密局部性与特征多样性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">EMA teacher 与跨尺寸蒸馏把大模型的稳定目标迁移到多种容量的无标签 student。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Curate a balanced, deduplicated pretraining corpus via embedding retrieval and train a scalable ViT family with composite self-distillation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Automated data curation pipeline + DINO + untied-head iBOT + KoLeo sphere uniformity regularizer + high-resolution short adaptation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Composite DINO Image Loss + iBOT Patch MIM Loss + KoLeo Uniformity Regularizer.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">DINOv2 是强通用初始化，但 LVD-142M 并非医学策展集，细粒度病理和三维成像仍存在域差。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">医学部署应分别验证冻结特征、全量微调和参数高效适配，不能把自然图像零样本性能等同于临床泛化。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Forms the direct algorithmic backbone of modern pathology foundation encoders (UNI, Virchow, Prov-GigaPath) and RAD-DINO.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Gold-standard frozen visual feature extractor; natural-image weights still benefit from in-domain medical adaptation for 3D/grayscale.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=a68SUt6zFt\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>DINOv2: Learning Robust Visual Features without Supervision</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
